{"sections":[{"slug":"微分分次范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"微分分次范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">微分分次范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"微分分次范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">交换环</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的微分分次范畴</span> (differential graded category, “dg category”) <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> “$k$-<span lang=\"zh\">线性</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/稳定无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"” <span lang=\"zh\">的一种模型</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也等同于充实于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Eilenberg–MacLane谱","text":"Eilenberg–MacLane <span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":" $Hk$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的模范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Mod}(Hk)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">或</span> $\\mathsf{Mod}(Hk)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":";\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{DGCat} = \\mathsf{Mod}(\\mathsf{Mod}(Hk)).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">微分分次范畴构成</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{DGCat}$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中的乘法称为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Lurie张量积","text":"Lurie <span lang=\"zh\">张量积</span>"}},{"Plain":". "},{"Local":{"url":"/紧生成范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧生成</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的微分分次范畴是</span> $\\mathsf{DGCat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可对偶对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可对偶对象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">单对象的微分分次范畴等同于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/微分分次代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">微分分次代数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">作为充实</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义交换环</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的微分分次范畴为</span> $k$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/链复形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">链复形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Ch}(k)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}